      "category": "src_content",
      "full_page": "Feast of Purification 1900 A.D. God Present. \"If Directors are not men of prayer,\" says S. Teresa, Their learning will avail little; for many go astray by wishing to have the Spirit of God in their minds without try- ing to possess it in their hearts. \"Forsake all and thou shalt find all; re- linquish desire & thou shalt fine rest.\" Imitation Book III-32 \"Quaerite legendo et invenietis meditando; pulsate orando et aperietur vobis contem- plando\" S. Bernard \"The poor stretch forth the hand; but God receives what is offered.\" St. Peter Chrysologus (+450 aged 35 C & E.D.)",
